==Strategy==
The Gories are the main threat here, so bring [[:Category:Anti-Aku Cats|Anti-Aku]] or [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|Anti-Angel]] meatshields and attackers. For Anti-Aku Meatshields, [[Matador Cat (Rare Cat)|Talented Bellydance Cat]] is really useful, and for anti-Angel [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] is extremely important. Using fast attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] is important, since they will get more hits against the quick Gories.

